
USAGE
	NNetrom

DESCRIPTION
	Lists the NetRom neighbours of this node (/proc/net/nr_neigh):
	number, callsign, device, quality, lock, count of routes using
	the neighbour, failed links and digipeaters.
	In colour, the callsign is shown with the "connected" colour
	of Links when the AX.25 link to the neighbour is up, in light
	yellow when there is none (NetRom opens the link when
	needed and closes it when idle).
	A neighbour whose AX.25 link is awaiting connection is marked
	"SABM n/N" (retries done / allowed).
	NN is enough.
